issed the `-L` check and was\nallowed.\n\nFix: a bare token takes one `-L` test in the cwd (not counted toward\n`path_cap`; the 10 s budget and every cap still deny). Trailing `/` and\n`/.` are stripped inside the existing bounded trailing-strip loop (a\nlone `/` stays); a token that still ends in a strippable character after\n`strip_cap` rounds denies (fail closed). `plugin.json` patch-bumped\n(0.4.98 to 0.4.101) as the plugin-version gate requires on each commit.\n\nRED first: new rows failed before the fix (bare, bare in punctuation,\ntrailing slash, bare trailing slash, doubled slash, bare doubled slash,\nbare `/./`), now pass. Controls: absolute leaf alias denied, plain file\nand benign symlink (bare) allowed, existing timing rows unchanged.\n\nThe ticket stays open. Remaining, deliberately not done: `$VAR`\nexpansion, server-name variants, matrix-at-runtime, watchdog, and the\n`@alias.md`, `file:///` and markdown-link spellings (listed in a ticket\ncomment).\n\n## Ticket coverage\n\n- bare and trailing-slash leaf symlink alias tokens: done\n- doubled-slash and slash-dot leaf symlink alias tokens: done\n- leaf symlink resolve (relative and absolute): done\n- jq failure after `jq empty` denies: done\n- `/.salus` ancestor probe: done\n- `$VAR` expansion, server-name variants, matrix-at-runtime, watchdog:\ndeferred → HIMMEL-5723\n\nPlatforms tested: linux\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nleg-burn: calls=31 avg-ctx=86.4k first-turn=54.6k compactions=0\ncost-eq=411.0k profile=leg-impl\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-17T11:28:03Z","author":{"name":"yotamelo","email":"88616986+yotamleo@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1271237172,"node_id":"R_kgDOS8WKNA","name":"Himmel","full_name":"yotamleo-org/Himmel","private":false,"owner":{"login":"yotamleo-org","id":344898079,"node_id":"O_kgDOFI66Hw","avatar_url